# Logs
*.log
# ...except evidence logs under docs/testing/, which are deliverable artifacts:
# 006 T017/T018 cite docs/testing/availability-probe-24h.log as the artifact that
# closes 001 T049, so it has to survive a clone rather than sit only on the demo machine.
!docs/testing/*.log
# The probe's raw console echo is not evidence — the .log table above is.
docs/testing/probe-stdout.log
# Supervisor trace + the probe's redirected streams (T086). Same reasoning:
# runtime noise, and Start-Process truncates its redirect targets.
docs/testing/.probe-runtime/

